{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Classified as regression. The omitted updated_at in the upsert set_ mapping dates to the original schema in ADEVX-1 (3ed3ff9) and was latent and harmless on its own. The orphan reconciler added in ADEVX-95 (b5968c0) started reading that frozen column as an activity timestamp, which is what turned a dormant defect into cancelled successful runs and duplicate admissions."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789961307734726001,"uuid":"8aee4dab-4b52-47f7-9b18-a96024ffdacb"}